<title>NETHERLANDS: Nutricia abandons talks on Swedish stake.</title>
<headline>Nutricia abandons talks on Swedish stake.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food group Nutricia NV said on Monday it had abandoned negotiations on taking a minority stake in Sweden's food supplements manufacturer Vitamex.</p>
<p>&quot;After long negotiations, Nutricia established that Vitamex was not the company that it was seeking, which led to the recent stoppage of the talks,&quot; the Dutch group said.</p>
<p>Nutricia added it would not change its policy aimed at strengthening of its position in the market for food supplements such as vitamins and minerals.</p>
